MODULE: ProbeAdvancesCursor
TARGET: ProbeReadOnly
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: the digest comparison advances the peer's high-water-mark cursor
PERTURBS: ProbeCompare

--- FIND
    /\ IF Diverged # {} THEN phase' = "mismatch" ELSE phase' \in {"idle", "mismatch"}
    /\ UNCHANGED dataVars
--- REPLACE
    /\ IF Diverged # {} THEN phase' = "mismatch" ELSE phase' \in {"idle", "mismatch"}
    /\ hwm' = clock
    /\ UNCHANGED <<aStore, bStore, inflight, applied, wal, journal, walFloor, clock>>
--- END
